    {
      "text": "PRISMA flow diagram of study selection for Truenat assays (Appendix 2A). From 1175 database records (524 duplicates removed), 651 were screened and 34 reports assessed, all excluded (including 8 for wrong age group); 4 further reports from other methods were also excluded. No studies were included.",
